      "id": "claim_e96fc639f5e74489a249503b34cf7a24",
      "statement": "React Native Web rewrites the RN `testID` prop to the DOM attribute `data-testid`, and frontend/mcm-app/playwright.config.ts keeps both halves of that contract — the inline comment \"React Native Web renders testID as data-testid\" on the line above and `testIdAttribute: 'data-testid'` in the `use` block — so `playwright.getByTestId()` and `[data-testid=\"...\"]` locators resolve against components authored with the RN `testID` prop rather than a web-only attribute.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/mcm-app/playwright.config.ts#L84-L96",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:39915bbd6571b09dbcf5dc1b85c213e953686a57c4a81c9490583d10b826c2e1:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_cf11e7ec91674fd2875e1efc8fec10f2",
      "statement": "Every `[data-testid=\"...\"]` and `getByTestId()` selector across `frontend/mcm-app/tests/e2e/web/**` depends on that single `testIdAttribute` config line continuing to match React Native Web's actual output attribute: a Playwright default change or an RN Web rewrite change breaks the whole web E2E suite at once, not a single spec.",
