      "id": "claim_23b2e72f51914cb297a5caf90e112780",
      "statement": "Components must be authored with the React Native `testID` prop, never a raw `data-testid` prop, so that the same source serves both the Playwright web suite and the Maestro native mobile flows: the RN host node maps `testID` to `data-testid` on web and to `id` on native, so Jest/RNTL unit tests, Playwright specs and `tests/e2e/mobile/*.yaml` assertions all locate the same element.",
