      "statement": "The mapping is not confined to spec bodies: the shared global setup (`tests/e2e/web/setup/global-setup.ts` login and fixture seeding), the helpers under `tests/e2e/web/setup/`, and `scripts/cleanup-e2e-data.ts` all drive the app through `[data-testid=\"...\"]` locators, so a testID mismatch fails during setup before any spec body runs.",
